   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 4,000eb<br><strong>Type:</strong> Neuralware<br><strong>Install:</strong> Mall<br><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 14 (4d6)<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p>Chipware. One of five Cyberware Enhancements becomes available to the user while this is in: Spatial Mapping, Data Tunnelling, Limiter Removal, Vulnerability Analytics, or Launch Capacity Override. The choice is locked in at purchase. Only one Combat Software chip can be installed at a time, though swapping between chips costs a single Action. This copy enables Launch Capacity Override.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>Goes in a Chipware Socket: install the socket first, then install this into it.</li><li>One item per choice, since the choice is fixed at purchase.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
